This directory is the "LocalFeed" NuGet package source declared in the repo
nuget.config (<add key="LocalFeed" value="./nugets" />).

It must exist even when empty: NuGet restore hard-fails with NU1301
("The local source '.../nugets' doesn't exist") on a fresh checkout otherwise,
because git does not track empty directories. This placeholder keeps the empty
feed present so restore falls through to nuget.org. Drop local .nupkg files here
if you need to override a package with a private build.
